"""One run-bound fixed synthetic WORLD_GENERATE through the reviewed SSH route.

Importing performs no I/O. The provider controller owns Start-relative budgets,
cancellation and ordinary Stop. Existing transport/helper sources stay unchanged.
Only reviewed, hash-pinned compressed Python modules are sent, entirely in memory.
No credentials or raw artifact data are emitted in logs.
"""
